  {
    "index": 3,
    "hash": "8CbldjPliuVqHQfBy20aTTQzRn8=",
    "timestampUtcMs": "2026-08-19T11:29:04.441Z",
    "action": {
      "type": "SET_CONTENT",
      "input": {
        "content": "SRC is recorded as the largest Slovenian-owned integrator, working both banking and public sector, at around 300 staff. Domestic ownership is the part worth noting: in a market where many large integrators are subsidiaries of foreign groups, a domestically owned firm sets its own technology direction rather than inheriting one.\n\nIt also covers both verticals the lead set targets, which is unusual at that size. What is absent is everything technical \u2014 the stack was not researched and no open-source posture was established \u2014 so the lead is qualified on ownership, scale and sector coverage alone. Priority 3.\n\n---\n\n## Leads sharing this finding (1)\n\n**3 \u00b7 later**\n- SRC d.o.o. (SI \u00b7 300)\n\nVerbatim research text this claim was extracted from:\n\n> Largest Slovenian-owned integrator; banking and public.",
        "updatedAt": "2026-08-19T11:29:04.441348Z"
      },
      "timestampUtcMs": "2026-08-19T11:29:04.441354Z"
    }
  },
